{
  "summary": "This experiment tested replacing avgpool with transformer aggregation in a PCA-based multiprofile RNA-only setup, achieving validation accuracy of 0.5191 (F1: 0.4797). The result is lower than previous PCA-based avgpool setups (config_002) and scvi_n200-based models (config_003), suggesting transformer aggregation may not provide consistent benefits in this configuration. The exact impact of aggregation method versus encoder choice remains uncertain without direct comparison, and the role of alternative RNA encoders or image modalities is still unclear."
}

